OL,3,ABurnham pledges devolution deals and
OL,4,A'stronger public control' of services
OL,5,Ain first address to MPs
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe also pays tribute to his predecessor
OL,8,FKeir Starmer - who earlier announced he
OL,9,Fwill stand down as an MP - for a
OL,10,F"lifetime of public service", and
OL,11,Fpledges to continue his support for
OL,12,FUkraine
OL,14,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch says
OL,15,Fthe "country needs him to succeed" as
OL,16,FPM, but his ideas are about "more
OL,17,Fgovernment control, more spending, more
OL,18,Ftax"
